            "tooltip": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Report Information Author: Rachwen Mosbehi Tool: Power BI (Version: January 2025)  This HR Analysis report leverages Power BI to provide a comprehensive overview of employee interviews conducted across U.S. regions. It analyzes five workplace policies: Health, Pay Policy, Performance, Safety, and Working Hours. The report highlights employee sentiment trends (Unhappy, Neutral, Happy), tracks policy acceptance rates across different interview rounds, and visualizes satisfaction levels by position and geography. It equips HR professionals with actionable insights to evaluate workforce perceptions and tailor interventions for improved job satisfaction and policy effectiveness.'"
